abstract: >-
  A source-stratified benchmark for complete reference-set review from measured
  multiphase powder X-ray diffraction patterns under a fixed candidate library
  and review budget. It reports candidate-scale, source, tie and endpoint
  sensitivity alongside retrieval performance.
